# Dose of Dawnglow: "Return target creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield. Then if it isn't your main phase, blight 2".
# Cast in Bot1's own main phase on turn 3 it only returns the Shimmercreep (Bolted twice on turn 2): no counters, a 3/5, and the
# Shimmercreep's drain runs again (Bot2 20 -> 19 -> 18, Bot1 20 -> 21 -> 22). The twin that casts it on Bot2's turn is
# "...-off-your-main-phase-returns-the-creature-and-blights-it".

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Shimmercreep
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Dose of Dawnglow
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Island x16

